#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:6
msgid "Getting Your FedEx API Credentials"
msgstr "FedEx API資格情報を取得中"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:8
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to set up your FedEx developer account and obtain API "
"credentials"
msgstr "FedEx開発者アカウントを設定し、API資格情報を取得するには、以下の手順に従ってください。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:16
msgid "Create a FedEx Developer Account"
msgstr "FedEx開発者アカウントを作成"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:17
msgid ""
"Visit the FedEx Developer Portal and sign up for a free developer account."
msgstr "FedEx開発者ポータルにアクセスし、無料の開発者アカウントを登録してください。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:23
msgid "Open FedEx Developer Portal"
msgstr "FedEx開発者ポータルを開く"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:27
msgid "You'll need a valid email address and basic business information."
msgstr "有効なメールアドレスと基本的な事業情報が必要です。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:35
msgid "Create a New Project"
msgstr "新規プロジェクトを作成"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:36
msgid "After logging in to your developer account:"
msgstr "開発者アカウントにログインした後:"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:38
msgid "Click 'Create New Project' or navigate to 'My Projects'"
msgstr "'Create New Project'をクリックするか、'My Projects'に移動してください。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:39
msgid ""
"Give your project a descriptive name (e.g., 'My Store Shipping Integration')"
msgstr "プロジェクトに説明的な名前をつけてください（例: 'My Store Shipping Integration'）。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:40
msgid "Select the APIs you need (at minimum: Ship, Track, Rates)"
msgstr "必要なAPIを選びましょう（最低でも: Ship, Track, Rates）。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:41
msgid "Accept the terms of service"
msgstr "サービス利用規約に同意する"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:49
msgid "Generate API Credentials"
msgstr "API資格情報を生成"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:50
msgid "In your project dashboard:"
msgstr "プロジェクトダッシュボード内:"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:52
msgid "Navigate to 'API Credentials' or 'Keys & Secrets'"
msgstr "'API Credentials'または'Keys & Secrets'に移動してください。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:53
msgid "Click 'Generate New Credentials' or 'Create API Key'"
msgstr "'Generate New Credentials'または'Create API Key'をクリックしてください。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:54
msgid "You will receive an API Key (Client ID) and API Secret (Client Secret)"
msgstr "API Key（クライアントID）とAPI Secret（クライアントシークレット）を受け取ります。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:55
msgid "Copy both values immediately - you'll need them in the next step"
msgstr "両方の値をすぐにコピーしてください - 次のステップでそれらが必要になります"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:59
msgid "Important!"
msgstr "重要!"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:60
msgid ""
"FedEx will only show your API Secret once. Make sure to save it securely "
"before closing the page."
msgstr "FedExはAPI Secretを一度だけ表示します。ページを閉じる前に安全に保存してください。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:68
msgid "Choose Your Environment"
msgstr "環境を選択してください"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:69
msgid "FedEx provides two environments for API integration:"
msgstr "FedExはAPI統合用の2つの環境を提供しています:"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:72
msgid "Test Environment"
msgstr "テスト環境"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:73
msgid ""
"Use this for development and testing. It allows you to simulate shipments "
"without creating real labels or charges. Recommended for initial setup."
msgstr "開発とテストに使用してください。これは、実際のラベルや料金を作成せずに配送をシミュレートできる環境です。初期設定には推奨されます。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:76
msgid "Production Environment"
msgstr "本番環境"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:77
msgid ""
"Use this for live shipments with real tracking numbers and charges. Requires"
" account approval from FedEx."
msgstr "実際の追跡番号と料金を使用したライブ配送に使用してください。FedExのアカウント承認が必要です。"

#: providers/fedex/setup_instructions.html:82
msgid ""
"Start with the Test environment to verify your integration works correctly "
"before switching to Production."
msgstr "Production環境に切り替える前に、Test環境から統合が正しく動作することを確認してください。"

